# Sync SRM Controller

A Kubernetes safety interlock that pauses deployments when system synchronization is lost.

## Core Principle

Reliability is a function of timing:

G = (τ_obs + τ_act) * ω

If G ≥ 1 → system enters Blind Zone → automation is paused.

## Components

- SRM: real-time signal provider
- Controller: Kubernetes enforcement layer
- CRD: SyncMonitor

## Behavior

- Monitors system volatility
- Computes synchronization risk
- Pauses deployments when observability is invalid

